                                "text": "One brought two boxes of instant mami noodles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "936aeb56-cfc5-4938-80f6-cefe95fe5d23",
                                "sense_id": "fa5dd134-b252-3472-9f18-35b954425df8",
                                "text": "When her awaited bus arrives, she passes up instant mami noodles for a chance to dip her hand in a box of old shoes."
